0..76 Comment "// The higher-cells subject\'s shared declarations, written once and imported"
77..149 Comment "// by every source that reads them (`import \"./magma-base.gandr\";`): the"
150..223 Comment "// magma signature whose two corollas `ua` reads, and the translators its"
224..300 Comment "// models\' tables are given by — the swap of the booleans, the identity on"
301..376 Comment "// them, and the identity on the unit\'s one injection. A `ua[n, k]` path is"
377..452 Comment "// derived degree by degree over the signature\'s matching objects (Shulman,"
453..514 Comment "// _Univalence for Inverse Diagrams and Homotopy Canonicity_,"
515..549 Comment "// doi:10.1017/S0960129514000565)."
551..608 Comment "/// A magma: one sort, a binary operation and a constant."
